DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmaacc__ffrroomm__tteexxtt() function converts the text representation of a label
     into the internal policy label format (_m_a_c___t) and places it in _*_m_a_c,
     which must later be freed with free(3).

     The mmaacc__ttoo__tteexxtt() function allocates storage for _*_t_e_x_t, which will be set
     to the text representation of _l_a_b_e_l.

     Refer to maclabel(7) for the MAC label format.

